Here are two samples I've made:
- [reproducing the original issue](http://workable-camera.surge.sh/)
- [with the issue fixed](http://cut-song.surge.sh/)

In order to fix the issue, you need to only use a single value for the filter and use the string form of the value like so:

```js
var search = instantsearch({
  // Replace with your own values
  appId: 'JTH1JDTDFT',
  apiKey: '1d8e2d4aa2a19623ee5fc10fb0d85f83', // search only API key, no ADMIN key
  indexName: 'test-is-toggle',
  searchParameters: {
    disjunctiveFacetsRefinements: {
      "is-popular": ["true"],
    }
  }
});
```
